#: ../../tools/rxnorm_extended_tools.rst:32 dd5a6fde588c4425843dbcd700a48722
msgid ""
"**Description**: Resolve a drug name to its RxNorm RXCUI (RxNorm Concept "
"Unique Identifier) using the NLM RxNorm API. Returns one or more RXCUIs "
"that match the drug name. RXCUI is the standard identifier needed for "
"subsequent RxNorm lookups. No API key required. Examples: 'metformin' -> "
"RXCUI 6809; 'warfarin' -> RXCUI 11289; 'Tylenol' -> RXCUI 161 "
"(acetaminophen)."
msgstr ""

