#: ../../tools/rxnorm_extended_tools.rst:36 1b82b81f9ddd4196992d31b49e6f2155
msgid ""
"``drug_name`` (string) (required) Drug name to look up (generic, brand, "
"or synonym). Examples: 'metformin', 'Lipitor', 'acetaminophen', 'warfarin"
" sodium'."
msgstr ""

