#: ../../tools/rxnorm_extended_tools.rst:55 d4d6720b9c034ad9b7c9dea1907f9572
msgid ""
"Fetch comprehensive drug properties from NLM RxNorm by RXCUI or drug "
"name. Returns the canonical ..."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/rxnorm_extended_tools.rst 737b36e0f7574880a471a8c6823f94bb
