#: ../../tools/rxnorm_extended_tools.rst:61 4a0608d51a4c426f84fcf13a9812d4af
msgid "**Name**: ``RxNorm_get_drug_info``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/rxnorm_extended_tools.rst:63 6995cc2a46994f82b0005f1a0f1b8e25
msgid ""
"**Description**: Fetch comprehensive drug properties from NLM RxNorm by "
"RXCUI or drug name. Returns the canonical name, term type (ingredient, "
"brand name, clinical drug product, etc.), synonym, and language. Term "
"types include IN (Ingredient/generic), BN (Brand Name), SCD (Semantic "
"Clinical Drug = generic product with dose), SBD (Semantic Branded Drug). "
"No API key required. Example: RXCUI 860975 -> '24 HR metformin "
"hydrochloride 500 MG Extended Release Oral Tablet' (SCD)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/rxnorm_extended_tools.rst:67 dff9397394524866a46eda49060dfeb1
msgid ""
"``rxcui`` (string) (optional) RxNorm Concept Unique Identifier (e.g., "
"'6809' for metformin, '11289' for warfarin). Use RxNorm\\_find\\_rxcui to"
" obtain this."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/rxnorm_extended_tools.rst:70 e23261016ec74ca9a24e79c8c37d6a46
msgid ""
"``drug_name`` (string) (optional) Drug name to look up if RXCUI is not "
"known. Will auto-resolve to RXCUI first."
msgstr ""

