msgid "**RxNorm_get_related_drugs** (Type: RxNormExtendedTool)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/rxnorm_extended_tools.rst:88 ceb9462465964e64971c2e8c405d5a6d
msgid ""
"List all related drug products (branded names, generic products, "
"ingredient names) for a drug RXC..."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/rxnorm_extended_tools.rst d3ad076a202d4a35b8d1bfa3a7d692b5
msgid "RxNorm_get_related_drugs tool specification"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/rxnorm_extended_tools.rst:94 02a1ddc6648d41aeacdf15e7a4ae7153
msgid "**Name**: ``RxNorm_get_related_drugs``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/rxnorm_extended_tools.rst:96 e7fc0c259a4e4a8f86df535d910083f4
msgid ""
"**Description**: List all related drug products (branded names, generic "
"products, ingredient names) for a drug RXCUI or name using the NLM RxNorm"
" API. Returns grouped results by term type: Ingredient, Brand Name, "
"Semantic Clinical Drug (generic product with dose/form), and Semantic "
"Branded Drug (brand product). Useful for finding all brand names for a "
"generic drug, or vice versa. No API key required. Example: metformin "
"(RXCUI 6809) returns Glucophage, Glumetza, Fortamet as brand names plus "
"dozens of generic products."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/rxnorm_extended_tools.rst:100 81e59c6be7654fafa4f25ec3f3b6d9aa
msgid ""
"``rxcui`` (string) (optional) RxNorm Concept Unique Identifier. Use "
"RxNorm\\_find\\_rxcui to resolve a drug name."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/rxnorm_extended_tools.rst:103 4e41ff91db714b3893e3e1f93c1171f0
msgid ""
"``drug_name`` (string) (optional) Drug name to look up if RXCUI is not "
"known."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/rxnorm_extended_tools.rst:106 ae4d26aea8984415948d28b1777804bf
msgid ""
"``tty`` (string) (optional) Space/plus-separated term types to include. "
"Options: IN (ingredient), BN (brand name), SBD (branded drug), SCD "
"(generic clinical drug), PIN (precise ingredient). Default: "
"'IN+BN+SBD+SCD'."
msgstr ""

